<title>POLAND: NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 100 MLN OF 182-DAY BILLS.</title>
<headline>NBP OFFERS TO SELL PLN 100 MLN OF 182-DAY BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Poland offered to sell 100 million zlotys worth of its 182-day bills at a tender for money market dealers on Friday with a July 4 value date.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
